<title>BAHRAIN: Philippines' Ramos holds talks with Bahraini emir.</title>
<headline>Philippines' Ramos holds talks with Bahraini emir.</headline>
<dateline>MANAMA 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Philippines President Fidel Ramos on Monday held talks with Bahrain's Emir Sheikh Isa bin Sulman al-Khalifa and discussed ways of boosting ties, the official Gulf News Agency said.</p>
<p>Ramos, who arrived in Manama earlier in the day from Qatar, expressed the Philippines' interest in increased political, economic, commercial and labour ties with the Gulf Arab state.</p>
<p>He is urging Gulf Arab states to pump capital into his country's oil industry and economy.</p>
</text>
